              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Opleveringschouw {{opleveringschouwReferentie}} for project {{projectNumber}} — {{projectName}} was adopted by {{opleveringVastgesteldDoor}} on {{opleveringVastgesteldOp}}."
